22:["$","p","6",{"children":["Pour a small glass neat. Let it sit for two minutes, because the first nose out of the bottle is always the roughest. Then look for three things: fruit up front, warmth without burn in the middle, and a finish that stays after you swallow. If all three show up, someone made that brandy with intent."]}]
23:["$","p","7",{"children":["That is the standard we hold ours to. Made in Pretoria, aged three years, finished in French oak, and built to stand next to anything in the world."]}]
